        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-[#0f274a] font-serif tracking-tight mt-1">
          Automotive Lockout Scenarios We Handle Daily
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
          From simple cabin key lockouts to high-security German anti-theft deadlocks:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Scenario 1 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-black">
            🔑
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">Keys Locked Inside Cabin</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Keys sitting on the passenger seat or cup holder? We use non-marring vinyl wedges and specialized reach tools to retrieve them swiftly with zero mark on glass or trim.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Scenario 2 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-black">
            🚗
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">Keys Locked Inside Trunk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Especially common on BMW, Mercedes, and Audi models where interior trunk release buttons are disabled when armed. We decode the mechanical cylinder to pop the trunk.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Scenario 3 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-black">
            🚨
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">Priority Emergency Lockouts</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Child or pet locked inside, or vehicle running in an unsafe area? We treat these calls with the highest emergency priority and dispatch the closest mobile van immediately.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Scenario 4 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-black">
            ⚡
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">Dead Key Fob Battery Lockout</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            When your smart proximity fob dies and the hidden emergency door key slot is stiff or jammed, our technicians bypass the lock cleanly and replace your fob battery on the spot.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Scenario 5 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-black">
            ✂️
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">Broken Key in Door / Ignition</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Key snapped off inside the exterior door handle or ignition barrel? We extract the broken blade without replacing the cylinder and laser-cut a fresh replacement key.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Scenario 6 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-black">
            🚚
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">Commercial Fleet & Box Trucks</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Ford Transit, Mercedes Sprinter, Chevy Express, Ram ProMaster, and Freightliner delivery trucks. We unlock commercial vehicles quickly to keep your business running on schedule.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== 3-STEP EASY LOCKOUT PROCESS ==================== -->
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-16 bg-slate-900 text-white px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
      
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400 block mb-2">Simple Process</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black font-serif tracking-tight text-white mb-10">
        How Our Mobile Vehicle Unlock Service Works
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-left">
        
        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/15">
          <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            1
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-serif mb-2">Call (615) 625-8000</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Tell us your vehicle's Year, Make, Model, and your exact location (street, parking lot, or airport terminal). We provide an honest, upfront price quote.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/15">
          <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            2
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-serif mb-2">Mobile Van Dispatched</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Our marked locksmith van drives directly to your car, equipped with precision optical decoders, non-marking air tools, and laser cutting machines.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/15">
          <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            3
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-serif mb-2">Back on the Road Safely</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            We unlock your vehicle damage-free, verify your keys, and if needed, cut and program an extra spare key right then so you never get locked out again.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-10">
        <a 
          href="tel:6156258000" 
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-black text-base uppercase tracking-wider shadow-2xl transition active:scale-95 border border-emerald-400/40"
        >
          <span>Call (615) 625-8000 For Immediate Dispatch</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== FAQS ==================== -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-slate-50 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600">Answers to Common Questions</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-[#0f274a] font-serif tracking-tight mt-1">
          Car Unlock FAQs
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">
            Will unlocking my car damage the door, paint, or weatherstripping?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Never. Unlike amateur tow operators who use rigid metal rods or crowbars that bend door frames and tear weatherstripping, Armstrong Locksmith uses precision Lishi optical lock decoders and soft-vinyl non-marring air wedges to safely open your vehicle with zero structural or cosmetic damage.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">
            What if my keys are locked in the trunk and the interior trunk button is locked out?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Many modern vehicles (especially European brands like BMW, Mercedes, and Audi) disable interior trunk release buttons when the alarm is armed. Our mobile locksmiths can decode the physical trunk lock cylinder directly using Lishi tools or access the onboard diagnostic (OBD2) system to pop the trunk safely.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">
            What proof of ownership do I need for you to unlock my vehicle?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            For safety and legal compliance under Tennessee State Locksmith License #406, we require the driver to provide matching government ID along with vehicle registration, title, or valid insurance documentation before or immediately upon opening the vehicle.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0f274a] font-serif mb-2">
            Can you cut and program a brand new car key on-site if I lost them completely?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Yes! Our mobile vans are fully equipped mobile workshops with computer-controlled laser key cutters and OBD2 programming machines. If your keys are lost rather than locked inside, we can originate and program a new key on the spot so you don't have to tow your car.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>